Soyo Gakuen. The teacher from the original country who was in charge of the main character's class was hospitalized due to an accident, so she came temporarily. The impression that she is usually a modest and kind older sister. There are some things that are a little dodgy, and the harder you work, the more you get to spin. In addition, the teacher in the original country was also an advisor to the Occult Study Group, so she decided to take on that too."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c8778"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"事故で入院した現代国語の教師の代わりとして、創陽学園に赴任してきた臨時教師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のクラスを受け持つことにもなる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段はおっとりした雰囲気のお姉さんだが、少しドジなところもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"真面目で、生徒思いの教師を目指し、頑張っているようだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"入院した教師がオカルト研究会の顧問だったことから、その顧問も受け持つことになった。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12305","sourceWorkId":"3965","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"創陽学園に臨時で赴任してきた教師。主人公のクラスも受け持つ元々の現国の教師が事故により入院したということで、臨時で来た教師。普段はおっとりした優しいお姉さんという印象。少しドジっぽいところがあり、一所懸命になればなるほど空回りしてしまうようなところがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生徒思いで真剣に教師職をまっとうしようとしている。また、元々の現国担当の教師がオカルト研究会の顧問的なこともしていたので、それも受け持つことに。なので、オカルト研究会の皆と共に活動に参加する。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"144783"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"95 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12305","sourceWorkId":"3965","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"f","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12305","sourceWorkId":"3965","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"188 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12305","sourceWorkId":"3965","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"92 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12305","sourceWorkId":"3965","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"61 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12305","sourceWorkId":"3965","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"55 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12305","sourceWorkId":"3965","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/aa/aada99ce31da99d9b5dc70edd75b04213800e222be2eef5105f3ee37a25ce192.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/67/674164f344eb3ea841fe5e614c4ecb64f0036d6116728fa311837ad185357abf.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤咲かおり","creatorId":"vndb:s1182","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1182","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1182","name":"藤咲 かおり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:84842:144783:6105:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c8780","characterName":"光野 慎太郎","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"159921","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"84842"}],"egsCharacterIds":["12306"],"vndbCharacterId":"c8780"},"originalCharacterName":"光野 慎太郎","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"178"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"63"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"天才肌なオカルト研究会部長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の友人。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12306","sourceWorkId":"3965","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"オカルト研究会の部長。主人公の友人。いつも冷静沈着で、話をする時も淡々と話し、一切感情を表に出さない。基本的には無口で、いつも黙々と本を読んでいる。都市伝説、怪談、民俗学的なことに異常なまでに詳しく、ある日光野の書いた論文が教師の目に止まり、よくよく調べれば、その分野の学説に一石を投じるほどのものだったことがわかる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それを私立である創陽学園が見逃すはずもなく、金の卵になるかもしれないということで、光野一人に対して研究用にとオカルト研究会が割り当てられたのだった。それに主人公を含めた皆が集まり、現在のオカルト研究会を形成している。それに加え、頭の回転が極めて早く、洞察力、先見性などに長けている。いわゆる天才肌。そのために、まわりが光野の意見を聞いても飛躍した意見にしか聞こえないこともしばしば。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"159921"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"178 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12306","sourceWorkId":"3965","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"63 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12306","sourceWorkId":"3965","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/04/04be2fa5269e56b68a7121de0e2bc3e02eca5b8fc847f68056da1acb9066f97b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d2/d28a8993473395370f9810940cfb4ce0757bcfd14136053547e71e596628ff22.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"児玉さとみ","creatorId":"vndb:s115","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s115","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s115","name":"児玉 さとみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:84842:159921:15954:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c8779","characterName":"？？？","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c8779"},"originalCharacterName":"？？？","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"68"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"139"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"69"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"50"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"33"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d3/d31bddc8755a0cb3b55504a7109b1e3e356380a4df076